	(text "2 x 20, 2.00 mm socket on the underside, mating the relay's J602 (pin numbers as on the relay).\n22R series resistors at the receiver on every output that leaves the board.  GSPI is bit-banged on\nSDI_GPIO3-6; RESET on SDI_GPIO7; LOCKED to SDI_GPIO1.  The relay has 2.2k pull-ups on SDI_I2C."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 15.24 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
